  "source_contract_confirmed": [
    "SweepWindow consumes economys[i].exp as raw/base Campaign EXP and economys[i].mana directly.",
    "SweepWindow begins from the pre-request lev/exp snapshot, applies 1x while simulated level <=10, and switches subsequent rows to SelfPlayer:getExpMulti() after crossing above 10.",
    "SelfPlayer:getExpMulti() returns 3 in effective src_64.",
    "BattleWinWindow uses campaign energy_cost as ordinary Campaign account EXP base; partner_exp is a different plane.",
    "CampaignTable reads mana_gain for Campaign Mana.",
    "Backend/SelfPlayer treat top-level economy_ as cumulative player synchronization and process exp/level/new_funcs/energy/mana through existing generic economy flow.",
    "Normal/Super sweep visibility is independently gated by 3 stars; this pass does not alter sweep authorization."
